{
  "utterance": "Theo, I'll take the objections contact for Phase 1, with limits. I can own the archive side: logging each excerpt's approval, recording corrections, and pulling a withdrawn excerpt from the approved list. My hours per week are an estimate until I see how many contributors we're contacting, so I won't promise a number today. I can't decide payment or the withdrawal turnaround alone. Leila's veto over excerpt and context is my default: contributor chooses, I record. Open question: if I'm the contact, who has authority to tell Jonas to remove something the same day?", "cites": ["M2"],
  "memory": "Will act as objections contact and archive recordkeeper for Phase 1; hours only an estimate. Supports contributor choice and veto of excerpt and context. Unresolved: payment, withdrawal turnaround, who authorizes same-day removal to Jonas."
}
